abstract: >-
  Trilingual research demonstrator for EPS technology evaluation, contextual
  recommendation, pedagogical scenario design and teaching support. The
  application uses documented and unverified real-app entries and heuristic
  matching. This candidate does not establish empirical educational efficacy
  or production readiness.
